  "integrationCoverage": [
    "Same four cases on real SQLite and PostgreSQL stores, SDK, Control HTTP, Worker pool and Kernel; model transport is synthetic.",
    "Manager-generated and role-directed planning, two concurrently admitted worker streams and frozen forks carrying a completed prior user/assistant exchange.",
    "Bounded reports mark truncation; worker forks do not observe sibling reports; exactly one original input and one final answer on the main thread.",
    "Final ordinary Run is gated while running, SSE disconnects after run.started, Control reopens, continuation delivers only events after its cursor, model delta and one run.completed.",
