    "A failed QA Run exhausts its existing sampling retries, manager recovery uses the same child branch, then manager delegation and selected-member main response finish.",
    "Requested Goal is paused throughout member work and resumed only by final main turn. Explicit Goal pause retains the user turn; a separate revision-bound Run cancel stops it and prevents continuation."
  ],
